  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1745530123_1773186_b529bce968389d3c72211a4a26a6d2c0.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"125\">One Bio Health</strong> is a premium health and wellness brand committed to helping individuals optimize performance, longevity, and everyday vitality through science-backed, naturally formulated supplements. With a focus on clean ingredients and targeted solutions, One Bio empowers people to take control of their health in all vectors of life.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our product line includes high-performance supplements designed to support key health goals such as hormonal balance, cognitive function, immune strength, digestive health, sleep, energy, and fat metabolism. Each formula is carefully researched and blended for maximum bioavailability and efficacy, using non-GMO, gluten-free, and stimulant-free ingredients wherever possible.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Targeted, research-driven formulas designed for real results&mdash;without unnecessary fillers, stimulants, or gimmicks. One Bio Health delivers clean, effective nutrition to fill modern health gaps and optimize performance from the inside out.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Net 30 available for affiliate partners. Payouts via Paypal or Store Credit.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All One Bio Health supplements are made in the USA in GMP-certified facilities, with third-party lab testing for purity and potency. Designed for those who demand quality and transparency in their health stack.</p>\r\n</div>",
